    "Scan of the 1979 edition of the Gross, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1978; aerial photographs from 1974; field checked in 1975; last revised in 1979; printed in 1980.",
    "Variations: woodland tint, orthophotomap. Sheet size: 24 x 28.8 inches. Printed projection: Transverse Mercator; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
